# Lecture 09F

## Two-Gene Tetrad Mapping

## Chapter 8

## Dr. Neil Voss

## November 3, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Classify tetrads using the given parental cross.
- Test linkage before calculating map distance.
- Work through linked and unlinked examples.

